         MACRO                                                          
&LBL     HWINCFG ,
         PUSH  PRINT                                                     
         AIF   ('&SYSPARM' NE 'SUP').WED01                              
         PRINT OFF,NOGEN                                                
.WED01   ANOP  ,
********************************************************************** 
*                                 
*        HWINCFG  -  Full-Screen Console Configuration
*                                                               
********************************************************************** 
         SPACE 1                                                          
HWINCFG  DSECT ,                  Full-Screen Configuration             
* +-----------------------------------------------+
* |      Console Device Definition                |
* +-----------------------------------------------+
HWINROWS DS    H              +0  Number of rows on screen              
HWINCOLS DS    H              +2  Number of columns on screen           
*
HWINADDR DS    XL2            +4  Virtual device address
*
HWINTYPE DS    XL1            +6  Console device type
HWIN3270 EQU   X'70'              -- 3270 class display
HWIN2741 EQU   X'41'              -- 2741 hardcopy device
HWIN3215 EQU   X'15'              -- 3210/3215 console
HWINDISC EQU   X'DC'              -- Disconnected
*
HWINOPTN DS    XL1            +7  Display device features
HWINCOLR EQU   X'80'              X....... Color
HWINHIGH EQU   X'40'              .X...... Extended highlight
HWINPSS  EQU   X'20'              ..X..... Programmed Symbol Sets
HWIN14BT EQU   X'10'              ...X.... 14-bit addressing     
*        EQU   X'08'              ....X... (not used)
*        EQU   X'04'              .....X.. (not used)
*        EQU   X'02'              ......X. (not used)
*        EQU   X'01'              .......X (not used)
* +-----------------------------------------------+
* |      Console Device CP Configuration          |
* +-----------------------------------------------+
HWINSFL1 DS    XL1            +8  SET command options
HWINLEDT EQU   X'80'              X....... LINEDIT ON
HWINEMCD EQU   X'40'              .X...... EMSG CODE
HWINEMTX EQU   X'20'              ..X..... EMSG TEXT
HWINEMON EQU   HWINEMCD+HWINEMTX  .XX..... EMSG ON
*
HWINTFL1 DS    XL1            +9  TERMINAL command options:
HWINTATN EQU   X'80'              X....... ATTN ON
HWINTAPL EQU   X'40'              .X...... APL on
HWINTTXT EQU   X'20'              ..X..... TEXT on
HWINTHLT EQU   X'10'              ...X.... Hilight on
HWINSCSV EQU   X'08'              ....X... SCRNSAVE on
HWINAUCR EQU   X'04'              .....X.. AUTOCR on
HWINHOLD EQU   X'02'              ......X. HOLD on
HWINTSTP EQU   X'01'              .......X TIMESTAM on
*
HWINTFL2 DS    XL1            +A  TERMINAL options (cont):
HWINTMCP EQU   X'80'              X....... Terminal Mode CP
HWINCM70 EQU   X'40'              .X...... Terminal conmode 3270
HWINBKGC EQU   X'20'              ..X..... Terminal Breakin Guestctl
*        EQU   X'10'              ...X.... (not used)
*        EQU   X'08'              ....X... (not used)
*        EQU   X'04'              .....X.. (not used)
*        EQU   X'02'              ......X. (not used)
*        EQU   X'01'              .......X (not used)
*
HWINBKEY DS    XL1            +B  Terminal BRkkey
HWINLNEN DS    CL1            +C  Terminal Linend
HWINLDEL DS    CL1            +D  Terminal LineDel
HWINCDEL DS    CL1            +E  Terminal Chardel
HWINESCP DS    CL1            +F  Terminal Escape
HWINTAB  DS    CL1           +10  Terminal Tabchar
HWINTMCD DS    XL1           +11  RDEVTMCD
HWINLSIZ DS    H             +12  Terminal Linesize
HWINMOR1 DS    H             +14  Terminal MORE NN mm
HWINMOR2 DS    H             +16  Terminal MORE nn MM
*         
DEFLEND  EQU   C'#'               Default LINEND
DEFLDEL  EQU   X'4A'              Default LINEDEL (cent sign)
DEFCDEL  EQU   C'@'               Default CHARDEL
DEFESC   EQU   C'"'               Default ESCAPE
DEFTAB   EQU   X'6A'              Default TABCHAR (broken vertical)

HWINVDEV DS    0XL4           +18 Virtual Device CP Information
HWINVCLS DS    XL1                .. VDEVTYPC
HWINVTYP DS    XL1                .. VDEVTYPE
HWINVSTA DS    XL1                .. VDEVSTAT
HWINVFLG DS    XL1                .. VDEVFLAG
*
HWINRDEV DS    0XL4           +1C Real Device CP Information:
HWINRCLS DS    XL1                .. RDEVTYPC
HWINRTYP DS    XL1                .. RDEVTYPE
HWINRMDL DS    XL1                .. RDEVMDL
HWINRLLN DS    XL1                .. RDEVLLEN
*
HWINCFLN EQU   *-HWINCFG
HWINCFLD EQU   (HWINCFLN+7)/8
         EJECT ,
         POP   PRINT
         MEND
         